# =========================================================
# Module OCR output (BackEnd/app/ocr/output/) - KHONG bi ignore.
#
# Day la ket qua cuoi cung cua Module OCR (ocr_final_results.json - {img_path, texts}
# cho toan bo keyframe), la input truc tiep cho Module Text-Embedding buoc sau, nen
# CAN duoc push/commit binh thuong - khac voi cac thu muc "outputs/"/"results/" o
# tren (danh cho output tam thoi/experiment, khong dung o day).
#
# Anh crop trung gian giua Detection/Recognition khong con ghi ra dia nua (giu dang
# numpy array trong RAM, truyen thang trong cung 1 process - xem muc 3 module_ocr.md),
# nen khong con file/thu muc debug nao khac trong output/ can ignore.
# =========================================================